		"uploadDate": "2023-06-24T12:00:28-07:00",
		"description": "Rurouni Kenshin - the legendary masterpiece comes back to life as a brand-new TV anime in July 2023! \n\n🍁Visit the official website at: https://rurounikenshin-anime.com\n\n🍁Follow the official Facebook page at: https://facebook.com/RurouniKenshin.anime/\n\n🍁Follow the official Twitter page at: https://twitter.com/rurounikenshin \n\nAbout Rurouni Kenshin: \nWith over 72 million copies of the comic series sold and a total box office revenue of 19.3 billion yen from the live-action movie series, the legendary masterpiece loved by all generations worldwide, Rurouni Kenshin comes back to life as a brand-new TV anime in 2023. \n \nThe original work was serialized in Weekly Shonen Jump in 1994, and in 1996 it was made into a TV anime for the first time. Since then, it has undergone numerous developments, from OVAs to theatrical releases, and now with Rurouni Kenshin: The Hokkaido Arc serializing in Jump SQ.\n \nThis long-awaited work aims to reconstruct the original story from the first episode using the latest animation technology, to create a Rurouni Kenshin anime that will appeal to current anime fans.\n \nFor the animation production, talented staff such as director Hideyo Yamamoto (Strike the Blood) and Hideyuki Kurata (Made in Abyss) for series composition were gathered. The cast members will be renewed, with Soma Saito in the role of Kenshin Himura. \n \nAfter nearly 30 years of serialization, the new TV anime Rurouni Kenshin is coming soon.\n \n[ STAFF ]\nOriginal Work: Nobuhiro Watsuki \"Rurouni Kenshin\" (JUMP COMICS / SHUEISHA)\nDirector: Hideyo Yamamoto\nSeries Composition: Hideyuki Kurata\nCharacter Designer: Terumi Nishii\nMusic: Yu Takami\nProduction: LIDENFILMS\n\n\n[ CAST ]\nKenshin Himura: Soma Saito\nKaoru Kamiya: Rie Takahashi\nSanosuke Sagara: Taku Yashiro\nYahiko Myojin: Makoto Koichi\nMegumi Takani: Saori Onishi\nAoshi Shinomori: Yuma Uchida\n\n\n#RurouniKenshin #Anime #Aniplex\n\n\n©Nobuhiro Watsuki/SHUEISHA, Rurouni Kenshin Committee"
